  "content": "<center>\n\n![Plastic Texture Pack 標頭圖片](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/meEXwbr9/images/29df06d58d88d40da984af34c90b1dfd74c68759.jpeg)\n\n<center><span><strong><font size=\"5\">塑膠材質包</font></strong></span></center>\n<p></p>\n\n---\n\n<a href=\"\">\n  <img alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/plastic-texture-pack-lce\">\n  <img alt=\"curseforge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/BrandonItaly/LCE-Resources\">\n  <img alt=\"github-plural\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/github-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/BrandonItaly\">\n  <img alt=\"ghsponsors-plural\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/ghsponsors-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/brandonitaly\">\n  <img alt=\"kofi-plural\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<p></p>\n\n讓你的世界變得簡潔、多彩且充滿活力！\n<p></p>\n\n這款色彩鮮豔、風格簡潔的材質包為方塊、物品和實體添加了塑膠主題的材質，並帶來了全面改造的使用者介面。\n<p></p>\n\n<details open>\n<summary>預覽</summary>\n  \n![建築預覽](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/meEXwbr9/images/cfadd3a9d283fc6c2ce3e1b8c51218a24c5a1583.jpeg)\n\n![櫻花林](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/meEXwbr9/images/e09f5053b0eff932e177364dfe21e3c62e23f555.png)\n\n![河流](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/meEXwbr9/images/3a0495b23abac8b7b953f234567e91bf0d0d9c81.png)\n\n![河邊的牛](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/meEXwbr9/images/263f7f30a9a155950dd3260ef4643b27502ec0f8.png)\n\n![針葉林村莊](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/meEXwbr9/images/27d8f9444282ac424f279a80025fd3f1da663154.png)\n\n![使用者介面